{
  "id": "2CH.15",
  "number": "15",
  "bookId": "2CH",
  "reference": "2 Chronicles 15",
  "verseCount": 19,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "15",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "2CH 15"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "15",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 15:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The Spirit of God came upon Azariah son of Oded, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.15.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.15.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 15:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "and he went to meet King Asa. He called out, “Listen to me, King Asa, and all you people of Judah and Benjamin! The ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.15.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.15.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " is with you as long as you are with him. If you look for him, he will let you find him, but if you turn away, he will abandon you. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.15.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.15.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 15:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "For a long time Israel lived without the true God, without priests to teach them, and without a law. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.15.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.15.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 15:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "But when trouble came, they turned to the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.15.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.15.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ", the God of Israel. They searched for him and found him. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.15.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.15.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 15:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "In those days no one could come and go in safety, because there was trouble and disorder in every land. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.15.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.15.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 15:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "One nation oppressed another nation, and one city oppressed another city, because God was bringing trouble and distress on them. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.15.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.15.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 15:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "But you must be strong and not be discouraged. The work that you do will be rewarded.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.15.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.15.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 15:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.15.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.15.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 15:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "When Asa heard the prophecy that Azariah son of",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.15.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.15.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15.8",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Some ancient translations",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Azariah son of",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "; Hebrew does not have these words.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Oded had spoken, he was encouraged. He did away with all the idols in the land of Judah and Benjamin and all the idols in the cities he had captured in the hill country of Ephraim. He also repaired the altar of the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.15.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.15.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " that stood in the temple courtyard.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.15.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.15.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 15:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.15.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.15.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 15:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Many people had come over to Asa's side from Ephraim, Manasseh, and Simeon, and were living in his kingdom, because they had seen that the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.15.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.15.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " was with him. Asa summoned all of them and the people of Judah and Benjamin. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.15.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.15.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 15:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "They assembled in Jerusalem in the third month of the fifteenth year that Asa was king. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.15.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.15.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 15:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "On that day they offered sacrifices to the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.15.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.15.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " from the loot they had brought back: 700 head of cattle and 7,000 sheep. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.15.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.15.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 15:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "They made a covenant in which they agreed to worship the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.15.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.15.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ", the God of their ancestors, with all their heart and soul. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.15.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.15.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 15:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Anyone, young or old, male or female, who did not worship him was to be put to death. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.15.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.15.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 15:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "In a loud voice they took an oath in the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.15.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.15.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "'s name that they would keep the covenant, and then they shouted and blew trumpets. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.15.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.15.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 15:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "All the people of Judah were happy because they had made this covenant with all their heart. They took delight in worshipping the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.15.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.15.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ", and he accepted them and gave them peace on every side.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.15.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.15.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 15:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.15.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.15.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 15:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "King Asa removed his grandmother Maacah from her position as queen mother, because she had made an obscene idol of the fertility goddess Asherah. Asa cut down the idol, chopped it up, and burnt the pieces in the valley of the Kidron. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.15.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.15.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 15:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Even though Asa did not destroy all the pagan places of worship in the land, he remained faithful to the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.15.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.15.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " all his life. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.15.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.15.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 15:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "He placed in the Temple all the objects his father Abijah had dedicated to God, as well as the gold and silver objects that he himself dedicated. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.15.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.15.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 15:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "There was no more war until the 35th year of his reign.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.15.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.15.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "next": {
    "id": "2CH.16",
    "number": "16",
    "bookId": "2CH"
  },
